@SSE_HostAddress = http://localhost:5250

### Plain stream - Results.ServerSentEvents
GET {{SSE_HostAddress}}/orders/realtime
Accept: text/event-stream

### Stream with ids - TypedResults.ServerSentEvents(SseItem<T>)
GET {{SSE_HostAddress}}/orders/realtime/with-replays
Accept: text/event-stream

### Reconnect and replay everything after event 3
GET {{SSE_HostAddress}}/orders/realtime/with-replays
Accept: text/event-stream
Last-Event-ID: 3

### Only one customer's orders
GET {{SSE_HostAddress}}/orders/realtime/mine?customerId=alice
Accept: text/event-stream

### Push an order into the stream by hand
POST {{SSE_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "manual-1",
  "customerId": "alice",
  "amount": 129.99,
  "placedAt": "2026-08-29T10:00:00Z"
}

###
